    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking into some premature longitudinal cracking on a new asphalt section we laid in Phoenix recently. Can you give me a summary of the common causes for this kind of pavement failure, specifically looking at thermal expansion and bitumen issues?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
